{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"c837f467a020938eec4ea2e106f9662e4fc510f07ebe6c3afbf22ab35e3647fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你們要稱你們的弟兄為阿米",{"noteId":3},"，稱你們的姊妹為路哈瑪",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不貞的歌篾－不忠的以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你們要與你們的母親大大爭辯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她不是我的妻子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不是她的丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫她除掉臉上的淫像","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和胸間的淫態，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得我剝她的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她赤體，與才生的時候一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她如曠野，如乾旱之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因渴而死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不憐憫她的兒女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們是從淫亂而生的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的母親行了淫亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懷他們的母做了可羞恥的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她說：我要隨從所愛的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的餅、水、羊毛、麻、油、酒","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是他們給的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我必用荊棘堵塞她的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"築牆擋住她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她找不着路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必追隨所愛的，卻追不上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必尋找他們，卻尋不見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便說：我要歸回前夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我那時的光景比如今還好。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不知道是我給她五穀、新酒，和油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又加增她的金銀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她卻以此供奉","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"巴力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此到了收割的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出酒的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必將我的五穀、新酒收回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必將她應當遮體的羊毛和麻奪回來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我必在她所愛的眼前顯露她的醜態；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必無人能救她脫離我的手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必使她的宴樂、節期、月朔、安息日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並她的一切大會都止息了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必毀壞她的葡萄樹和無花果樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是她說「這是我所愛的給我為賞賜」的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使這些樹變為荒林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為田野的走獸所吃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必追討她素日給諸巴力燒香的罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時她佩帶耳環和別樣妝飾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隨從她所愛的，卻忘記我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝對他子民的愛"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"後來我必勸導她，領她到曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對她說安慰的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她從那裏出來，我必賜她葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又賜她亞割谷作為指望的門。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必在那裏應聲","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與幼年的日子一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與從埃及地上來的時候相同。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和華說：「那日你必稱呼我伊施",{"noteId":7},"，不再稱呼我巴力",{"noteId":8},"；"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["因為我必從我民的口中除掉諸巴力的名號，這名號不再提起。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["當那日，我必為我的民，與田野的走獸和空中的飛鳥，並地上的昆蟲立約；又必在國中折斷弓刀，止息爭戰，使他們安然躺臥。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我必聘你永遠歸我為妻，以仁義、公平、慈愛、憐憫聘你歸我；"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["也以誠實聘你歸我，你就必認識我－耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：那日我必應允，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必應允天，天必應允地；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必應允五穀、新酒，和油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些必應允耶斯列民","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必將她種在這地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"素不蒙憐憫的，我必憐憫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"本非我民的，我必對他說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必說：你是我的上帝。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"就是我民的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"就是蒙憐憫的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：製造","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：歌唱","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":15}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"就是我夫的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"就是我主的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"-","text":"耶斯列就是上帝栽種的意思","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":22}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}